return {h=16,w=1,cr=90,hc=20,bh=70,gr="medium-slow",eg={"indeterminate"},st={45,50,45,115,55,95},ab={{26,0}},genus={en="Gas Pokémon",es="Pokémon Gas",pt="Pokémon Gás"},flavor={en={[1]="Because of its ability to slip through block walls, it is said to be from another dimension.",[2]="Because of its ability to slip through block walls, it is said to be from another dimension.",[3]="By licking, it saps the victim's life. It causes shaking that won't stop until the victim's demise.",[4]="In total darkness, where nothing is visible, HAUNTER lurks, silently stalking its next victim.",[5]="Its tongue is made of gas. If licked, its victim starts shaking constantly until death eventually comes.",[6]="It hides in the dark, planning to take the life of the next living thing that wanders close by.",[7]="HAUNTER is a dangerous Pokémon. If one beckons you while floating in darkness, you must never approach it. This Pokémon will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.",[8]="HAUNTER is a dangerous Pokémon. If one beckons you while floating in darkness, you must never approach it. This Pokémon will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.",[9]="If a HAUNTER beckons you while it is floating in darkness, don’t approach it. This Pokémon will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.",[10]="If you get the feeling of being watched in darkness when nobody is around, HAUNTER is there.",[11]="Because of its ability to slip through block walls, it is said to be from another dimension.",[12]="It can slip through any obstacle. It lurks inside walls to keep an eye on its foes.",[13]="It licks with its gaseous tongue to steal the victim’s life force. It lurks in darkness for prey.",[14]="It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.",[15]="In total darkness, where nothing is visible, HAUNTER lurks, silently stalking its next victim.",[16]="Its tongue is made of gas. If licked, its victim starts shaking constantly until death eventually comes.",[17]="It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.",[18]="It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.",[21]="It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.",[22]="It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.",[23]="If you get the feeling of being watched in darkness when nobody is around, Haunter is there.",[24]="It licks with its gaseous tongue to steal the victim’s life force. It lurks in darkness for prey.",[25]="Haunter is a dangerous Pokémon. If one beckons you while floating in darkness, you must never approach it. This Pokémon will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.",[26]="Haunter is a dangerous Pokémon. If one beckons you while floating in darkness, you must never approach it. This Pokémon will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.",[27]="It strikes at humans from total darkness. Those licked by its cold tongue grow weaker with each passing day until they die.",[28]="It fears the light and revels in the dark. It may be on the verge of extinction in cities that stay brightly lit at night.",[29]="On moonless nights, Haunter searches for someone to curse, so it’s best not to go out walking around.",[30]="It’s dangerous to go outside alone on nights when you’re feeling sad. Haunter will catch you, and you won’t be able to go back home.",[31]="By licking, it saps the victim’s life. It causes shaking that won’t stop until the victim’s demise.",[32]="By licking, it saps the victim’s life. It causes shaking that won’t stop until the victim’s demise.",[33]="Its tongue is made of gas. If licked, its victim starts shaking constantly until death eventually comes.",[34]="If you get the feeling of being watched in darkness when nobody is around, Haunter is there.",[39]="This frightful, malevolent spirit can glide through walls, appearing wherever it likes. According to rumor, victims of a Haunter's lick will wither to death day by day."},es={[23]="Cuando tienes la sensación de que te están observando, seguro que es porque Haunter está cerca.",[24]="Utiliza su lengua gaseosa para chupar la vida de la víctima. Acecha a sus presas en la oscuridad.",[25]="Haunter es un Pokémon peligroso. Si se ve alguno flotando en la oscuridad y haciendo señas, conviene no acercarse. Este Pokémon intentará robarle la energía a su presa a base de lametazos.",[26]="Haunter es un Pokémon peligroso. Si se ve alguno flotando en la oscuridad y haciendo señas, conviene no acercarse. Este Pokémon intentará robarle la energía a su presa a base de lametazos.",[27]="Surge de la oscuridad para atacar a la gente. Las víctimas de sus lametazos se debilitan poco a poco hasta que se les escapa la vida.",[28]="Rehúye la luz y adora las noches oscuras. En las ciudades su presencia es casi inexistente, pues por la noche todo se ilumina.",[29]="Se aconseja no salir a pasear en las noches de luna nueva, cuando los Haunter acechan en busca de su próxima víctima.",[30]="Quienes se sientan tristes no deben salir solos por la noche, pues Haunter estará al acecho, los atrapará y no podrán volver a casa.",[31]="Sus lengüetazos le arrebatan la energía vital a su víctima y le causan unos temblores que no cesan hasta que fallece.",[32]="Sus lengüetazos le arrebatan la energía vital a su víctima y le causan unos temblores que no cesan hasta que fallece.",[33]="Su lengua está hecha de gas. Si lame a su víctima, esta sufrirá constantes temblores hasta fallecer.",[34]="Cuando se tiene la sensación de ser observado en la oscuridad sin que haya nadie alrededor, seguro que es porque un Haunter anda cerca."},pt="Este espírito assustador e maligno atravessa paredes e aparece onde quiser. Dizem que as vítimas lambidas por um Haunter definham dia após dia até morrer."},evo={{s=92},{s=93,from=92,c={{t="level-up",lv=25}}},{s=94,from=93,c={{t="trade"}}}},moves={[1]={1,122,1,109,1,101,29,95,38,138},[2]={1,122,1,109,1,101,29,95,38,138},[3]={1,95,1,122,1,180,8,180,13,212,16,174,21,101,31,109,39,138,48,194},[4]={1,95,1,122,1,180,8,180,13,212,16,174,21,101,31,109,39,138,48,194},[5]={1,95,1,122,1,180,8,180,13,212,16,174,21,101,25,325,31,109,39,138,48,194},[6]={1,95,1,122,1,180,8,180,13,212,16,174,21,101,25,325,31,109,39,138,48,194},[7]={1,95,1,122,1,180,8,180,13,174,16,101,21,109,25,325,31,138,39,194,45,247,53,171,64,212},[8]={1,95,1,122,1,180,5,180,8,212,12,174,15,101,19,109,22,389,25,325,28,371,33,247,39,138,44,399,50,194,55,171},[9]={1,95,1,122,1,180,5,180,8,212,12,174,15,101,19,109,22,389,25,325,28,371,33,247,39,138,44,399,50,194,55,171},[10]={1,95,1,122,1,180,5,180,8,212,12,174,15,101,19,109,22,389,25,325,28,371,33,247,39,138,44,399,50,194,55,171},[11]={1,95,1,122,1,180,5,180,8,212,12,174,15,101,19,109,22,389,25,325,28,371,33,247,39,138,44,399,50,194,55,506,61,171},[12]={1,95,1,122,1,180,8,180,13,212,16,174,21,101,25,325,31,109,39,138,48,194},[13]={1,95,1,122,1,180,8,180,13,212,16,174,21,101,25,325,31,109,39,138,48,194},[14]={1,95,1,122,1,180,5,180,8,212,12,174,15,101,19,109,22,389,25,325,28,371,33,247,39,138,44,399,50,194,55,506,61,171},[15]={1,95,1,122,1,180,5,180,8,212,12,174,15,101,19,109,22,389,25,325,28,371,33,247,39,138,44,399,50,194,55,506,61,171},[16]={1,95,1,122,1,180,5,180,8,212,12,174,15,101,19,109,22,389,25,325,28,371,33,247,39,138,44,399,50,194,55,506,61,171},[17]={0,325,1,325,1,95,1,122,1,180,5,180,8,212,12,174,15,101,19,109,22,389,28,371,33,247,39,138,44,399,50,194,55,506,61,171},[18]={0,325,1,325,1,95,1,122,1,180,5,180,8,212,12,174,15,101,19,109,22,389,28,371,33,247,39,138,44,399,50,194,55,506,61,171},[19]={1,95,1,122,1,123,1,109,5,109,7,139,12,101,14,261,19,389,21,92,30,247,36,399,45,138},[20]={0,325,1,325,1,122,1,109,1,95,1,212,12,371,16,180,20,174,24,506,30,101,36,389,42,399,48,247,54,194,60,138},[23]={0